<h2>Edit family</h2>

<%= form_for(@administered_family, url: family_path, html: { method: :put }) do |f| %>

  <p>Your family code is:</p>
  <p class='family-code'><%= @administered_family.code %></p>
  <p>It's case-insensitive. Only share this code with people you trust, since anyone with the code can join your family and see everyone else's lists.</p>

  <p><%= f.label :name, 'Family name' %></p>
  <p><%= f.text_field :name %></p>

  <p>If you're looking for a way to delete your family, this will occur automatically if all family members delete their accounts.</p>

  <%= f.submit 'Update', class: 'btn btn-primary' %>
<% end %>
